{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618130/extras/LoadingA.jpg?t=1751885044\" /></div><strong>Party Harvest: Farm, Raise Animals, and Build Friendships with Friends!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This demo version includes main systems like <strong>planting crops</strong>, <strong>caring for animals</strong>, <strong>buying and selling goods</strong>, and <strong>fishing</strong>. Best of all, you can <strong>have fun playing together with your friends</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for endless fun in <strong>Party Harvest</strong>! This delightful farming game takes you into a vibrant <strong>2D world</strong> where you'll experience rural life to the fullest. With <strong>adorable characters</strong> that bring charm to your farm, you can <strong>grow various crops</strong>, harvesting fresh produce, and <strong>raise cute animals</strong> like cows, chickens, and pigs that'll liven up your farm. You can also head out to <strong>fish</strong> in nearby ponds or rivers, bringing in catches to cook or sell for income across the <strong>diverse maps</strong> available for exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But Party Harvest isn't just about farming! You can also <strong>build relationships with unique townsfolk</strong>, learning their stories, helping with quests, and forging great friendships. Or, venture into the <strong>mines</strong> to uncover valuable ores and hidden treasures in unique mining maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most importantly, Party Harvest lets you <strong>play with many friends</strong>! Invite your crew to build your dream farm together. Help each other water crops, till the soil, exchange items, or even throw parties to celebrate your harvest. Enjoy competing in farming challenges or cooperating to build the greatest agricultural empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Party Harvest</strong> promises a fun, relaxing, and friendship-filled farming experience. Whether you're into growing crops, raising animals, or love to explore, Party Harvest has something for everyone!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618130/extras/ezgif-5ccb48ae03d887.gif?t=1751885044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caring for and raising animals on your farmCaring for and raising animals on your farm<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618130/extras/ezgif-275dbd0f6d69b2.gif?t=1751885044\" /></div>Come build your farm with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618130/extras/ezgif-3273b2230c5235.gif?t=1751885044\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618130?t=1751885044","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618130/81809b639c524af0060b7e805c33ed67ea3f6541/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751885044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618130/43acb05a6f5a65419bd1d72b62b840e1fa59a2d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751885044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618130/43acb05a6f5a65419bd1d72b62b840e1fa59a2d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751885044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><im